1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,154
The consequences arrived in the kitchen.

2
00:00:02,154 --> 00:00:15,013
Everyone in the central company could see the change in the food: brown rice instead of white, a drop of coffee in the morning, and a cheese sandwich instead of a chocolate bar.

3
00:00:15,013 --> 00:00:19,672
“The ingredient is not the point,” the physician said.

4
00:00:19,672 --> 00:00:28,055
“The mood is.” Thus the board asked a firm from the agency to give the club a new menu.

5
00:00:28,055 --> 00:00:31,240
The crucial question was the stove.

6
00:00:31,240 --> 00:00:43,992
A cooker that nobody had cleaned, a bundle of herbs in a silver clip, and a garbage bin beside the window: the condition of the kitchen decided the appetite of the whole team.

7
00:00:43,992 --> 00:00:48,521
“You cannot play on a hungry lung,” the cook said.

8
00:00:48,521 --> 00:00:52,836
“You can only look at the window and wish.”

9
00:00:52,836 --> 00:00:57,345
The stimulus was not the chocolate but the way it was given.

10
00:00:57,345 --> 00:01:08,838
A mild powder, a fraction of a banana, and a yoghurt with lemonade were enough for a stressful afternoon; a drastic bundle of stimulants was not.

11
00:01:08,838 --> 00:01:14,172
“A nerve is not a toy,” the physician wrote to the general manager.

12
00:01:14,172 --> 00:01:18,881
“A stimulant taken impulsively is a debt.”

13
00:01:18,881 --> 00:01:22,925
The deterioration of one player scared them all.

14
00:01:22,925 --> 00:01:36,433
A tumor the size of a staple, a lung full of dioxide, and an atomic scan later, the club joined the union of clubs that had asked for a national consolidation of the data.

15
00:01:36,433 --> 00:01:44,012
The utilization of the gym had to be examined, and the broom in the corner became a symbol.

16
00:01:44,012 --> 00:02:04,158
The headmistress of the local school, a member of the board, asked the question that closed the meeting: “What do you give a body that has no appetite?” The answer was a kitchen with a window, a stove that worked, and a routine that did not depend on the mood of the cosmos.

17
00:02:04,158 --> 00:02:10,392
The side of the argument that nobody wanted to hear was the only one that could be defended.

18
00:02:10,392 --> 00:02:21,420
The defense of the old kitchen was that the drug of habit is cheap; the daily grind of cooking for fifty people, however, was not intact.

19
00:02:21,420 --> 00:02:28,463
“You cannot buy stimulation in a packet without becoming impulsive,” the headmistress said.

20
00:02:28,463 --> 00:02:39,947
A broom, a staple gun, and a packet of chocolate were the only tools left in the room, and the physician wrote down every item.
